<p>The above are our API endpoints that our chat interface will use to communicate with the backend. We set up three main routes:</p>
<ol>
<li><code>/start</code>: Creates a new conversation for a user</li>
<li><code>/message</code>: Handles sending messages and getting responses from the bot</li>
<li><code>/history</code>: Retrieves past messages from a conversation</li>
</ol>
<p>Each route connects to our chat service to perform its specific task. We&#x27;ll use these routes to build our chat interface in the next section.</p>
